@startuml
[*] --> Waiting : Start Date Arrives
Waiting --> Active : Current Date Equals or Surpasses Start Date
Active --> Expired : Finish Date is Reached
Expired --> Archived : One Year from Expiration Date Passes
Active --> [*] : End of Validity Period
Expired --> [*] : No Further Processing
Archived --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
